Package: mate-wacom
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, x11-xserver-utils, xserver-xorg-input-wacom
Description: graphics tablet settings window for MATE
 GTK 3 settings utility for Wacom tablets and pens. It reads and writes
 X11 Wacom driver settings through xsetwacom and can map a tablet to a
 selected display area.
